# Scrapbook App

## Environment Variables

# Azure Storage
STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING=UseDevelopmentStorage=true

# PostgreSQL
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://localdev:localdevpassword@localhost:5432/scrapbookdb

# Azure OpenAI (optional - AI captions will use fallback without these)
AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT=
AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Auth
AUTH_SECRET=dev-secret-change-in-production
